# to-goal-skill session latch

When using `to-goal-skill` in this workspace:

1. Maintain `docs/to-goal/.session.md` with `active`, `mode`, `attempt`, `approved`, goal, and ACs.
2. Before user approval: `approved: false` — do not edit business files; do not run `npx skills add`.
3. Writes under `docs/to-goal/` are allowed while unapproved (session + exported cards).
4. After explicit user approval of the orchestration card: set `approved: true`, then execute.
5. When finished or abandoned: set `active: false`.

Optional hard enforcement: install hooks from `integrations/cursor/README.md`.
